  "releaseNotes": "- [ThunderPropagator#84] [Feature] HTTP REST endpoints — add Protobuf and MessagePack input/output formatters and Accept-header content negotiation (ThunderPropagator.Web) Open   src/ThunderPropagator.Infrastructure/Formatters/ — 6 new files:   - FormatInputFormatter.cs — abstract base: resolves IFormatDeserializer by SerializerType from DI, reads request body bytes, deserializes via reflection-based generic call   - FormatOutputFormatter.cs — abstract base: resolves IFormatSerializer, serializes to bytes, sets Content-Type, writes to response stream   - ProtobufInputFormatter.cs / ProtobufOutputFormatter.cs — bind to SerializerType.Protobuf + application/x-protobuf   - MessagePackInputFormatter.cs / MessagePackOutputFormatter.cs — bind to SerializerType.MessagePack + application/x-msgpack",
